This archive was created by the `ansible-imessage-backup` automation. The
export is plaintext and should be protected as sensitive private data.

Source diagnostics are saved in `diagnostics.txt`. Structural verification is
saved in `verification.json`. Redacted Apple download-metadata availability is
saved in `mmcs-recovery-audit.json`.
{% if imessage_preserve_source_data %}

`{{ imessage_source_preservation_directory_name }}/chat.db` is a consistent
snapshot of the source Messages database. `source-preservation.json` and
`{{ imessage_source_preservation_directory_name }}/attachment-manifest.json`
map every database attachment row to archived bytes or document why its source
file was unavailable. Independent hash verification is saved in
`source-preservation-verification.json`.
